    "zh-CN": "情绪会感染人，数据也会感染人。AI 时代真正需要建立的，不是完全隔离数据，而是让人和系统在接触数据时仍然保留距离、判断和确认。",
    "en": "Emotion can affect people, and data can affect people too. What the AI era needs is not complete isolation from data, but the ability for people and systems to maintain distance, judgment, and confirmation while coming into contact with data."
